          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ক্যানভাসটি অন্য জায়গায় বদলেছে, তাই আবার খোলা হয়েছে।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder and everything in it go to the vault's trash folder (.marrow/trash).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The folder and everything in it go to the vault's trash folder (.marrow/trash)."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ফোল্ডারটি ও এর ভেতরের সবকিছু ভল্টের ট্র্যাশ ফোল্ডারে (.marrow/trash) যাবে।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder to sync with. In Nextcloud: Files → Settings → WebDAV, then add a folder name.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The folder to sync with. In Nextcloud: Files → Settings → WebDAV, then add a folder name."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "যে ফোল্ডারের সাথে সিঙ্ক হবে। Nextcloud-এ: Files → Settings → WebDAV, তারপর একটি ফোল্ডারের নাম যোগ করুন।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder “%@” is locked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The folder “%1$@” is locked."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%1$@” ফোল্ডারটি লক করা।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The note as it is now is kept as a version too, so you can switch back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The note as it is now is kept as a version too, so you can switch back."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "নোটের বর্তমান রূপটিও একটি সংস্করণ হিসেবে রাখা হবে, তাই আবার ফিরে যেতে পারবেন।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The note is encrypted on disk and in sync. Without the password it can't be read, not even by you, so keep it somewhere safe.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The note is encrypted on disk and in sync. Without the password it can't be read, not even by you, so keep it somewhere safe."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "নোটটি ডিস্কে ও সিঙ্কে এনক্রিপ্ট করা থাকবে। পাসওয়ার্ড ছাড়া এটি পড়া যাবে না, আপনিও পারবেন না, তাই পাসওয়ার্ডটি নিরাপদে রাখুন।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
